  "description": "The long-awaited son of a Sioux chief and his wife is born under a terrifying omen. Will Moonlight Hair be the destroyer or his people or their redeemer? Set in the late 1860s, Moonlight Hair follows the story of a misfit struggling to fit into his tribe, without understanding why he must struggle so. He embarks on a quest to find the truth about his origins. Will he change his fate...or end it?\n\nSequel to *[Moonlit Hair](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=209651878)*.\n\n**Original Webtoon**\n\n***Note:** Postype combined both [Moonlit Hair](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=209651878) and [Moonlit Hair Season 2](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=2579433890) together on the same site.*",
